          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To onyo Rwoth waco ni, “I oro adek, paka jatic m'opangisa, dwoŋ pa Mowab ilaloko cay, makada nende jothoth, aka ma joboth jolabedo manok kareno joloc.”",
          "type": "text",
